raits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Sigma, who has the ability to retain memories, can continuously travel through time to understand and forge deeper relationships with these characters and successfully complete the project. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905790/extras/773e616a532fd530a8bbf01058a39b5f.poster.avif?t=1749190194\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905790/extras/773e616a532fd530a8bbf01058a39b5f.webm?t=1749190194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905790/extras/773e616a532fd530a8bbf01058a39b5f.mp4?t=1749190194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An intriguing story through time-traveling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through time and gather clues from the future, then return to the past to unravel the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seemingly insignificant details overlooked in the past will deeply impact the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the clues amidst an ever-changing landscape to successfully complete your mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905790/extras/f15f5637fcccf78a3780232cdcd9400e.poster.avif?t=1749190194\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905790/extras/f15f5637fcccf78a3780232cdcd9400e.webm?t=1749190194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905790/extras/f15f5637fcccf78a3780232cdcd9400e.mp4?t=1749190194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
